  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "스라크가 커트 기술을 마스터하게 도와주신\n당신이 도전해 주셨으면 하는 게 있어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2A4B77CD06CAC000020CEE4D2B80020AE30C220C7440020B9C8C2A4D130D558AC8C0020B3C4C640C8FCC2E0000AB2F9C2E0C7740020B3C4C804D5740020C8FCC168C73CBA740020D558B2940020AC8C0020C788C5B4C694002100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "칼로스지방에\n포켓몬리그가 있는 것처럼!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE7CB85CC2A4C9C0BC29C5D0000AD3ECCF13BAACB9ACADF8AC000020C788B2940020AC83CC98B7FC002100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티에는\n트리미앙리그가 있답니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D0B294000AD2B8B9ACBBF8C559B9ACADF8AC000020C788B2F5B2C8B2E4002100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트리미앙리그는\n엄선된 트리미앙 전문가들이<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n트리미앙의 강함을 겨루는 리그...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B9ACBBF8C559B9ACADF8B294000AC5C4C120B41C0020D2B8B9ACBBF8C5590020C804BB38AC00B4E4C77400100001BE00000AD2B8B9ACBBF8C559C7580020AC15D568C7440020ACA8B8E8B2940020B9ACADF8002E002E002E00100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사천왕이라고 불리는 4명의 트레이너가\n도전자를 기다리고 있죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACCC9CC655C774B77CACE00020BD88B9ACB29400200034BA85C7580020D2B8B808C774B108AC00000AB3C4C804C790B97C0020AE30B2E4B9ACACE00020C788C8E0002E00100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사천왕은 미르에 있는\n4개의 레스토랑에 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACCC9CC655C7400020BBF8B974C5D00020C788B294000A0034AC1CC7580020B808C2A4D1A0B791C5D00020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사천왕에게 도전하실 거라면\n지닌 포켓몬에는 트리미앙만 넣어야 해요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACCC9CC655C5D0AC8C0020B3C4C804D558C2E40020AC70B77CBA74000AC9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D0B2940020D2B8B9ACBBF8C559B9CC0020B123C5B4C57C0020D574C694002E00100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "관심 있으시다면 트리미앙리그 사천왕을\n모두 쓰러뜨려 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD00C2EC0020C788C73CC2DCB2E4BA740020D2B8B9ACBBF8C559B9ACADF80020C0ACCC9CC655C744000ABAA8B4500020C4F0B7ECB728B8240020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401420000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트리미앙리그 사천왕\n가부키컷 전문가 허영입니다.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B9ACBBF8C559B9ACADF80020C0ACCC9CC655000AAC00BD80D0A4CEF70020C804BB38AC000020D5C8C601C785B2C8B2E4002E001000020114015C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저에게 도전하실 생각이라면\n지닌 포켓몬에 트리미앙만 넣어 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C5D0AC8C0020B3C4C804D558C2E40020C0DDAC01C774B77CBA74000AC9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020D2B8B9ACBBF8C559B9CC0020B123C5B40020C8FCC138C694002E001000020114015C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가부키컷 트리미앙의 매력을\n승부를 통해 가르쳐 드리죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00BD80D0A4CEF70020D2B8B9ACBBF8C559C7580020B9E4B825C744000AC2B9BD80B97C0020D1B5D5740020AC00B974CCD00020B4DCB9ACC8E00021001000020114015C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부해요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D574C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠시만요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0C2DCB9CCC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가부키컷 트리미앙의\n멋진 모습을 자랑하게 해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00BD80D0A4CEF70020D2B8B9ACBBF8C559C758000ABA4BC9C40020BAA8C2B5C7440020C790B791D558AC8C0020D5740020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114015C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 트리미앙에게 어떤 커트가\n가장 매력적인지 정해 보도록 하죠!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020D2B8B9ACBBF8C559C5D0AC8C0020C5B4B5A40020CEE4D2B8AC00000AAC00C7A50020B9E4B825C801C778C9C00020C815D5740020BCF4B3C4B85D0020D558C8E00021001000020114015C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
