      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 78,
      "offsetInSection": 5296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D2B8B9ACBBF8C559B9ACADF8C7580020C815C810C740000AD2B8B9ACBBF8C559B9CCC73CB85C0020ACB0C815D574C57C0020D558B2940020BC95002E00100001BE00000AC9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC7400020D2B8B9ACBBF8C559B9CC0020B370B824C6400020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "트리미앙에 대한 사랑을 걸고\n진검승부를 펼치는 것이 트리미앙리그!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n자, 서로의 사랑을 부딪쳐 봅시다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 79,
      "offsetInSection": 5420,
