      "offsetInSection": 6000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC544C694002E002E002E00200035B1440020C804C7580020C0ACAC74C73CB85C0020C778D574000AD2B8B9ACBBF8C559C7440020CEE4D2B8D5740020C8FCB29400100001BE00000AADF8B8E8BC0D0020D3ECCF13C0B4B871C7740020D3D0C810D55C0020B4A4B85C002E002E002E00100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르의 트리미앙 애호가들은\n수많은 밤을 눈물로 지새웠어요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n더는 사랑하는 트리미앙의 커트를\n바꿔 줄 수 없게 될까 두려웠거든요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 6124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런 저희의 앞에\n구세주처럼 나타난 것이 바로...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 91,
      "offsetInSection": 6284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F00020C800D76CC7580020C55EC5D0000AAD6CC138C8FCCC98B7FC0020B098D0C0B09C0020AC83C7740020BC14B85C002E002E002E00100002011401600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕł",
